<span class="ltx_bibblock">Metaformer is actually what you need for vision.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <em id="bib.bib16.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Proceedings of the IEEE/CVF conference on computer vision and pattern recognition</em>, pages 10819–10829, 2022.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib17" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Fu et al. [2020]</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Justin Fu, Aviral Kumar, Ofir Nachum, George Tucker, and Sergey Levine.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">D4rl: Datasets for deep data-driven reinforcement learning.

</span>
